# Mail config

- New settings need all of: `application.properties` (`${ENV:default}`), `MailAppProperties`, `application-local.properties.example`, README env table.
- Defaults that send mail must be safe: prefer `mail.batch-enabled=false` and `mail.dry-run` (H2).
- Never put real passwords in `application.properties` or the example file.

```properties
# ❌ BAD
spring.mail.password=abcd-efgh-ijkl-mnop
mail.batch-enabled=true

# ✅ GOOD
spring.mail.password=${MAIL_PASSWORD:}
mail.batch-enabled=${MAIL_BATCH_ENABLED:false}
mail.dry-run=${MAIL_DRY_RUN:true}
```
